WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.064 --> 00:00:15.865
Sara always enjoyed receiving letters from her father.

2
00:00:17.365 --> 00:00:20.346
One day Captain Crewe wrote with very exciting news.

3
00:00:21.326 --> 00:00:24.227
A friend from his school days had come to visit him in India.

4
00:00:25.147 --> 00:00:27.788
The man owned some land where diamonds had been found.

5
00:00:28.724 --> 00:00:33.025
He asked Captain Crewe to become a partner in digging mines to find more diamonds.

6
00:00:34.726 --> 00:00:36.826
Captain Crewe hoped to make a lot of money.

7
00:00:38.007 --> 00:00:40.547
Sara was delighted by the idea of diamond mines.

8
00:00:41.568 --> 00:00:45.729
She told Ermengarde and Lottie stories of mines filled with sparkling stones.

9
00:00:46.989 --> 00:00:51.210
Ermengarde loved the stories, and Lottie insisted on hearing them every night.

10
00:00:52.691 --> 00:00:56.172
Most of the other students were also very excited about the diamond mines.

11
00:00:57.648 --> 00:00:59.290
Of course Lavinia was not.

12
00:01:00.771 --> 00:01:05.195
One day after classes were over, she sat by the schoolroom fire talking with Jessie.

13
00:01:06.316 --> 00:01:08.978
Other girls were talking or playing quietly nearby.

14
00:01:08.998 --> 00:01:13.462
"I don't believe in mines full of diamonds," said Lavinia.

15
00:01:13.482 --> 00:01:17.726
"If there were truly mines filled with diamonds, lots of people would be rich."

16
00:01:17.746 --> 00:01:22.630
"Well, diamonds have to come from somewhere," said Jessie.

17
00:01:22.650 --> 00:01:29.027
"I know, but Sara is just telling another one of her silly stories," Lavinia replied.

18
00:01:29.047 --> 00:01:34.130
"Speaking of Sara," Jessie said, "do you know what I heard?

19
00:01:34.911 --> 00:01:37.672
She likes to pretend that she's a real princess!

20
00:01:39.213 --> 00:01:43.416
She says that being a princess has nothing to do with how you look, or what you own.

21
00:01:43.856 --> 00:01:46.978
It has to do with what you think about, and how you act."

22
00:01:48.159 --> 00:01:49.560
Jessie giggled and went on.

23
00:01:50.584 --> 00:01:56.287
"She wants Ermengarde to be a princess too, but Ermengarde says she is too fat."

24
00:01:57.587 --> 00:01:58.668
Lavinia laughed.

25
00:01:58.688 --> 00:02:02.129
"Sara really is ridiculous.

26
00:02:02.609 --> 00:02:05.671
I think we should start calling her 'Your Royal Highness!'"

27
00:02:07.011 --> 00:02:10.373
Just then Sara entered the classroom, followed by Lottie.

28
00:02:10.393 --> 00:02:17.176
"There she is now, with that horrid little child," said Lavinia in a whisper.

29
00:02:18.308 --> 00:02:21.289
"I suppose Lottie will be screaming about something in a minute."

30
00:02:22.510 --> 00:02:25.431
Lottie joined a group of younger girls who were playing in a corner.

31
00:02:26.632 --> 00:02:30.713
Sara sat on the window seat and began reading a book about the French Revolution.

32
00:02:32.014 --> 00:02:35.895
She was soon lost in a story about a prison in France called the Bastille.

33
00:02:37.416 --> 00:02:39.957
Lottie started running and sliding across the floor.

34
00:02:43.279 --> 00:02:46.340
First she annoyed Lavinia and Jessie by making too much noise.

35
00:02:47.584 --> 00:02:49.165
Then she fell and hurt her knee.

36
00:02:49.185 --> 00:02:51.346
"Ow! Ow!

37
00:02:51.546 --> 00:02:52.646
Ow! My knee!"

38
00:02:53.146 --> 00:02:53.767
she howled.

39
00:02:55.007 --> 00:02:59.629
Some of the other younger girls started trying to comfort her while other girls shouted at her to

40
00:02:59.689 --> 00:03:00.549
stop screaming.

41
00:03:01.870 --> 00:03:02.850
Lavinia stood up.

42
00:03:02.870 --> 00:03:06.532
"Lottie, stop that noise right now, you crybaby!

43
00:03:06.912 --> 00:03:09.113
If Miss Minchin hears you, she'll come in here.

44
00:03:09.393 --> 00:03:10.834
You'll ruin things for everybody."

45
00:03:14.495 --> 00:03:17.701
you're quiet, I'll give you a penny," Jessie said.

46
00:03:17.721 --> 00:03:20.602
"I don't want your penny."

47
00:03:21.263 --> 00:03:22.083
Lottie sobbed.

48
00:03:24.384 --> 00:03:26.546
Then she noticed a spot of blood on her knee.

49
00:03:26.566 --> 00:03:28.667
"I'm bleeding!"

50
00:03:29.227 --> 00:03:31.348
She started howling all over again.

51
00:03:32.589 --> 00:03:35.050
Sara didn't like being interrupted when she was reading.

52
00:03:35.951 --> 00:03:38.392
But she flew across the room to comfort Lottie.

53
00:03:38.412 --> 00:03:41.454
"Now, Lottie," she said.

54
00:03:41.474 --> 00:03:44.496
"You promised that you wouldn't cry like this."

55
00:03:45.952 --> 00:03:48.513
"But Lavinia called me a crybaby!"

56
00:03:49.033 --> 00:03:49.673
Lottie said.

57
00:03:49.693 --> 00:03:54.234
"Come sit with me and I'll tell you a story," said Sara.

58
00:03:54.254 --> 00:03:57.755
"Will you tell me about the diamond mines?"

59
00:03:58.255 --> 00:03:58.916
asked Lottie.

60
00:03:58.936 --> 00:04:01.416
"The diamond mines?"

61
00:04:01.936 --> 00:04:03.537
said Lavinia, looking at Sara.

62
00:04:03.557 --> 00:04:06.538
"You're a nasty, spoiled little thing.

63
00:04:06.818 --> 00:04:08.078
I'd like to slap you."

64
00:04:09.419 --> 00:04:10.819
Sara turned to Lavinia.

65
00:04:10.839 --> 00:04:13.560
"Well, I'd like to slap you, but I won't.

66
00:04:14.764 --> 00:04:16.845
We're both old enough to know better."

67
00:04:16.865 --> 00:04:22.846
"Ah, yes, Your Royal Highness," Lavinia said mockingly.

68
00:04:22.866 --> 00:04:25.767
"We are princesses, I believe.

69
00:04:26.247 --> 00:04:27.868
Or at least one of us is.

70
00:04:28.368 --> 00:04:32.389
The school will be very popular now that Miss Minchin has a princess here!"

71
00:04:33.970 --> 00:04:37.531
Sara felt the blood rush up into her face and tingle in her ears.

72
00:04:38.511 --> 00:04:41.952
Sara's game of pretending she was a princess was the joy of her life.

73
00:04:43.016 --> 00:04:47.539
It was a secret that she had not shared with many people, only her closest friends.

74
00:04:48.779 --> 00:04:51.581
Now Lavinia was making fun of her in front of everyone!

75
00:04:53.002 --> 00:04:56.324
Sara raised her hand and was about to slap the older girl.

76
00:04:57.304 --> 00:05:02.747
Then she remembered something: if you were a princess, you did not fly into rages.

77
00:05:03.508 --> 00:05:05.048
And you did not hit people.

78
00:05:06.289 --> 00:05:07.930
Her hand dropped by her side.

79
00:05:07.950 --> 00:05:11.072
"It's true," Sara said.

80
00:05:12.016 --> 00:05:16.399
"I pretend I'm a princess so that I can try to behave like one."

81
00:05:17.759 --> 00:05:20.381
Lavinia blinked, and didn't know what to say.

82
00:05:21.481 --> 00:05:25.244
Often when she was dealing with Sara, Lavinia didn't know how to reply.

83
00:05:26.444 --> 00:05:29.966
But right now everyone in the room was waiting for her to say something.

84
00:05:29.986 --> 00:05:31.647
"Dear me!"

85
00:05:32.188 --> 00:05:32.988
she said at last.

86
00:05:33.008 --> 00:05:36.090
"I hope you won't forget us when you're queen!"

87
00:05:36.110 --> 00:05:40.168
"Oh, I won't," said Sara.

88
00:05:40.188 --> 00:05:42.874
She did not say another word but stood quite still.

89
00:05:44.056 --> 00:05:46.741
And then Lavinia took Jessie's arm and walked away.
